{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into <i>Bearly Escape</i>\u2014a one-of-a-kind VR animal rescue adventure\u2014where you\u2019ll solve mind-bending puzzles, sneak into sinister labs, master a skill-based claw machine, and navigate thrilling platforming challenges to rescue your dog and lead dozens of stuffed animals on a great escape from Dr. Kidd\u2019s twisted experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the Dreamlike World of Everwood</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your loyal dog, Robin, has vanished! Embark on a thrilling journey to track him down through Everwood\u2014a dreamlike world teeming with mystery, danger, and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/Bear_Attack_500.gif?t=1745410426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape Evil\u2019s Clutches, Save the Wilderness</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The animals have been kidnapped, transformed into stuffed toys, and trapped in claw machines. Can you outsmart their captor and bring them home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/Pet_10s_500.gif?t=1745410426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve Puzzles &amp; Outsmart the Wicked Dr. Kidd</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crack tricky puzzles to sneak into Dr. Kidd\u2019s secret labs and foil his dark experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/Puzzle_Bear_500.gif?t=1745410426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master the Claw in VR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of a high-tech drone claw to rescue animals trapped in claw machines.Precision and skill are your only way to set them free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/Claw_500.gif?t=1745410426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape in Platforming Challenges</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide rescued animals to safety through platforming levels with branching paths, dangerous obstacles, and sneaky dodging traps while collecting rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/Challenge_500.gif?t=1745410426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Restore Nature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every rescued animal helps bring Everwood back to life, turning barren wilderness into a vibrant ecosystem full of wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/extras/SmashThornsToRescue_500.gif?t=1745410426\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to claw your way to freedom?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3596370?t=1745410426","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3596370?t=1745410426","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/88701ec1f1061b60cfc5ef9bbce579ccb41199fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745410426","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596370/88701ec1f1061b60cfc5ef9bbce579ccb41199fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745410426","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into <i>Bearly Escape</i>\u2014a one-of-a-kind VR animal rescue adventure\u2014where you\u2019ll solve mind-bending puzzles, sneak into sinister labs, master a skill-base